  "description": "Use Ixxat.Vci4 package to access CAN interfaces from Ixxat/HMS Networks via .NET and VCI4-API. This package supports net40/net[5|6|7|8|9].0-windows and netcoreapp3.1. Mixed assemblies depend on universal runtime (VCRUNTIME140.dll).",
  "iconFile": "images\\HMSLogo.png",
  "id": "Ixxat.Vci4",
